<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Metromail started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Metromail started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp analyst Jackson Spears said he started coverage of Metromail Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the mail-order concern were up 7/8 to 20-5/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;Metromail's ongoing investment in its national consumer database and marketing database software has distinguished (it) as a leader in direct marketing,&quot; Spears said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
